  "body": "Call the WebDriver BiDi page show steps when the pageshow event fires, after a document loads and when a document is reactivated. Call the WebDriver BiDi page hide steps when the pagehide event fires while unloading a document.\n\nThis lets WebDriver BiDi clients know when a document restored from the back/forward cache is shown. No load event fires in that case.\n\nSee https://github.com/w3c/webdriver-bidi/issues/1019 and https://github.com/w3c/webdriver-bidi/pull/1217\n\n<!--\nThank you for contributing to the HTML Standard! Please describe the change you are making and complete the checklist below if your change is not editorial.\n\nWhen you submit this PR, and each time you edit this comment (including checking a checkbox through the UI!), PR Preview will run and update it. As such make any edits in one go and only after PR Preview has run.\n\nIf you think your PR is ready to land, please double-check that the build is passing and the checklist is complete before pinging.\n-->\n\nThis is needed for https://github.com/w3c/webdriver-bidi/pull/1217, which adds the `browsingContext.pageShow` and `browsingContext.pageHide` events (w3c/webdriver-bidi#1019).\n\nChanges:\n- \"The end\": after `pageshow` fires, invoke `WebDriver BiDi page show` with the document's navigation ID and `persisted` false. The step that sets the during-loading navigation ID to null now runs after this call, so the ID is still available. The call is guarded by a null check on the document's node navigable.\n- \"Reactivate a document\": after `pageshow` fires, invoke `WebDriver BiDi page show` with a null navigation ID and `persisted` true.\n- \"Unload a document\": after `pagehide` fires, invoke `WebDriver BiDi page hide` with the document's salvageable state as `persisted`. The navigation ID is the during-loading navigation ID of `newDocument` when it is given, and null otherwise. The navigable's ongoing navigation cannot be used here: \"apply the history step\" always sets it to \"traversal\" before the document unloads.\n\n- [x] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\n   * Mozilla\n   * Google\n- [ ] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\n   * TODO: will add wpt PR for wdspec tests for `browsingContext.pageShow` and `browsingContext.pageHide` once we have some basic agreement on the webdriver-bidi PR at https://github.com/w3c/webdriver-bidi/pull/1217\n- [ ] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\n   * Chromium: TODO\n   * Gecko: TODO   \n   * WebKit: TODO\n- [ ] [MDN issue](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) is filed: …\n- [x] The top of this comment includes a [clear commit message](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/COMMITTING.md) to use.\n\n(See [WHATWG Working Mode: Changes](https://whatwg.org/working-mode#changes) for more details.)\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/13296/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 20, 2026, 7:46 AM UTC (bb8d5bd)\">/browsing-the-web.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/13296/823898c...bb8d5bd/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 20, 2026, 7:46 AM UTC (bb8d5bd)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/13296/document-lifecycle.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 20, 2026, 7:46 AM UTC (bb8d5bd)\">/document-lifecycle.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/13296/823898c...bb8d5bd/document-lifecycle.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 20, 2026, 7:46 AM UTC (bb8d5bd)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/13296/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 20, 2026, 7:46 AM UTC (bb8d5bd)\">/infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/13296/823898c...bb8d5bd/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 20, 2026, 7:46 AM UTC (bb8d5bd)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/13296/parsing.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 20, 2026, 7:46 AM UTC (bb8d5bd)\">/parsing.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/13296/823898c...bb8d5bd/parsing.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 20, 2026, 7:46 AM UTC (bb8d5bd)\">diff</a> )",
